Upon your investigation you discover that the shrine has several locations where jewels appeared to have been located, but no longer exist. Checking your notes, the earthen mentions having prospected the jewels from a nearby mountain to the north.

Perhaps you can prospect the earth in that area to find more of those jewels. 
